  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO8 Pre-Primary and Primary Inclusive Education for Tanzania (PPPIET) &#x2013; Foundation phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ultimate programme goal is to foster quality sustainable IE for CWD at scale across Tanzania. It aims to align and support government priorities. The focus of this IE programme will be mainstream pre-primary and primary government schools. These units have the greatest scale of education coverage across Tanzania and provide the youngest-aged education services which the government has committed to support.</narrative>
  </description>
